      "enPatterns": ["air[- ]?raid", "civil defen[cs]e"],
      "summary": "A civil defense alert. Air raid (공습경보) means take shelter now. Alert warning (경계경보) means get ready to evacuate.",
      "actions": [
        "Alert warning (경계경보): get ready to evacuate right away. Move children and older people first.",
        "Air raid warning (공습경보): go quickly to an underground shelter or a protected spot.",
        "If you are driving, stop in an empty lot or on the right side of the road and take shelter.",
        "At night, turn off indoor and outdoor lights.",
        "At the shelter, keep listening to broadcasts and follow government instructions."
      ],
      "actionsSource": "https://www.safekorea.go.kr/safekorea-kor/acts/nacts/action-guide.do?category=civlAirDefenseWarning&menuSn=4",
      "needs_native_review": true
    },
    {
      "id": "earthquake",
      "en": "Earthquake",
      "ko": "지진",
      "patterns": ["지진", "여진", "지진해일"],
      "enPatterns": ["earthquake", "tsunami"],
      "summary": "An earthquake alert.",
      "actions": [
        "While it is shaking, get under a sturdy table and hold on to its leg.",
        "When the shaking stops, turn off gas and electricity and open the door to keep an exit.",
        "Leave by the stairs. Do not use the elevator.",
        "Outside, protect your head and stay away from buildings. Go to an open space such as a park. Do not evacuate by car.",
        "Near the coast with a tsunami alert (지진해일), move to high ground."
      ],
      "actionsSource": "https://eng.safekorea.go.kr/safekorea-eng/acts/nacts/action-guide.do?category=earthQuake&menuSn=1004",
      "needs_native_review": true
    },
