        "Stay away from rivers, streams, valleys, the coast and low or flood-prone areas.",
        "Never walk or drive through flooded roads, underpasses or bridges.",
        "If you are underground, in a low-lying area or in an old building, move to a safe place.",
        "If water starts coming into your building, move to a higher floor or a nearby evacuation point right away."
      ],
      "actionsSource": "https://eng.safekorea.go.kr/safekorea-eng/acts/nacts/action-guide.do?category=heavyRain&menuSn=1004",
      "needs_native_review": true
    },
